Template: swordfish-portable/install-dir
Type: string
Default:
Description: Folder to install Swordfish FM into:
 A Swordfish-Portable folder will be created inside this folder for ${USER}.
 Swordfish keeps its settings in Swordfish-Portable/portable-data, so ${USER}
 must be able to write to it. Use a folder in your home folder, /opt or a
 data drive that supports Linux permissions.

Template: swordfish-portable/invalid-dir
Type: error
Description: Cannot install into ${DIR}
 ${REASON}
